      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and affectionate animal handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently emphasize the gentle, loving approach shown to their pets during examinations, emergency admissions, and routine boarding. Reviewers share heartfelt stories of how veterinarians comforted frightened rescue animals, performed urgent surgeries, and guided families compassionately through end-of-life care. Pet owners express deep gratitude for treating animals like beloved family members."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and empathetic clinical team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise the clinical staff, citing Dr. Rodriguez, Dr. Bixby, and technician Cady for their warmth, professionalism, and thorough attention. Clients appreciate teams staying late for evening emergencies. A few reviewers, however, voiced disappointment regarding communication or diagnostic recommendations, but most clients describe a dedicated and compassionate staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed feedback on scheduling and wait times"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report contrasting experiences with clinic wait times and scheduling flow. Several pet parents praise the hospital for accommodating urgent same-day emergencies and providing prompt medical intake during late-night visits. Conversely, other clients experienced significant delays past scheduled appointment times or noted communication delays regarding telephone check-in."
      }
    }
  ],
